<title>USA: Fayetteville, N.C., won by Davenport &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Fayetteville, N.C., won by Davenport &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davenport &amp; Co of Virginia, Inc said it won $16.5 70 million of Fayetteville, N.C., various improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.9602 percent.</p>
